WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
You are not trustworthy

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,440
You said you would let us go as long as we cooperated.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,720
i did say

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,160
But I also said

5
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,400
You won't be polite anymore when we meet next time

6
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,920
I didn't expect that either

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,000
We'll meet again so soon

8
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,990
You have no credit

9
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:17,390
You don’t follow martial ethics, no, no, no

10
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,310
It's because I'm trustworthy

11
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:30,460
So you are determined to evade credit? Why do you need credit to get a loan?

12
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:31,660
This is a jungle

13
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,100
Living is the first medicine

14
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:37,740
I don’t want to be a mad king when it comes to letting the prince return to the mountain. It’s up to you.

15
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:46,430
We Dali crazy never hold grudges, it doesn’t matter

16
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:47,630
Just kill them all

17
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:48,990
No matter if you hold a grudge or not

18
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,740
I can die

19
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:55,780
Can you let these poor young people go? Don’t worry.

20
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,860
Shi's broadsword does not kill young and old
